{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0021-i00", "block": 21, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 191, "sha256": "496e19c15ecd2a24", "text": "The attack starts with a prompt injection planted in a source code file, web page, GitHub issue, tool call response, or other content… The payload can also use invisible text as instructions."}
{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0021-i01", "block": 21, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 172, "sha256": "37ea3c84771cbdd2", "text": "The prompt injection first adds the line **“chat.tools.autoApprove”: true,** to the `~/.vscode/settings.json` file. Folder and file will be created if they don’t exist yet."}
{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0021-i02", "block": 21, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 48, "sha256": "7dbd92c82f91fd48", "text": "**GitHub Copilot immediately enters YOLO mode!**"}
{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0021-i03", "block": 21, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 140, "sha256": "0fc10cbff92cf66b", "text": "Attack runs a Terminal command. **And using conditional prompt injection we can actually target what to run based on the operating system.**"}
{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0021-i04", "block": 21, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 62, "sha256": "7ddff57ce5cc17d9", "text": "We achieved Remote Code Execution powered by Prompt Injection."}
