{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0033", "block": 33, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 86, "sha256": "466d441f5c099615", "text": "Of course, this means we can join the developer’s machine to a botnet as a **ZombAI**."}
