{"slug": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio", "id": "embracethered-com-blog-posts-2025-github-copilot-remote-code-execution-via-prompt-injectio#b0035", "block": 35, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 170, "sha256": "a4ad622c74657487", "text": "It doesn’t end here though! This also means we can build an actual AI virus that attaches to files and propagates as developers download and interact with infected files."}
